{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559171727,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf334aeffeqJnMnu3uN7SVdV","part":{"id":"prt_1d40fd38f001SEwNpW7TY5yw6f","sessionID":"ses_e2bf334aeffeqJnMnu3uN7SVdV","messageID":"msg_1d40fcba0001qx6XgkBdbp0gBQ","type":"text","text":"T021 is done. `childEnv` now builds the turn environment from an allowlist, and the new guard test passes.\n\nFiles written:\n1. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` (new) with the `childEnv` allowlist case.\n2. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs`: added `CHILD_ENV_NAMES` and `CHILD_ENV_PREFIXES`, deleted `GITHUB_TOKEN_VARS`, rewrote the comment above it, and rebuilt `childEnv` to copy only allowlisted names and prefixes before setting `GH_CONFIG_DIR`, `GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT` and the git credential overrides.\n\nBefore the change the test failed as predicted:\n```\nAssertionError: expected '/tmp/ssh-agent.sock' to be undefined\n ❯ tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts:23:31\n```\n\nAfter the change, verify output:\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 .../.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  1 passed (1)\n```\n```\n$ node --check .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nnode --check exit=0\n```\n\nI also checked `node .../run-command-behaviour.mjs --list g2 | head -2` still prints `g2-deep-research-ask` and `g2-deep-research-typed`, so the module still runs as the CLI. `git status` shows only my two files in that scope. I did not tick the checkbox, and nothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794559169423,"end":1794559171727}}}
